[Cheats/Enable Debug Menus You will be brought to a movie test menu when you first activate the code. To return to the main debug menu, press the X button.Pressing L2 + Circle will take you to Debug screen: Select BSV. Pressing L1 + Circle will take you to Debug screen: 2D Viewer. Main Game Start Starts a new game normally. Main Game Start (Strongest Mode) Starts a new game with everything unlocked and max ammo. Launch 3D Viewer Enters the model viewer option. Sound Test Enters the sound test option.  Event Viewer Enters the event viewer option.]
